\n\nOkay, let's make sure I'm still seeing it. The center dot appears from Slice 2 and is clear through Slice 8. By Slice 9, it's elongating, so definitely a vessel. The diameter looks like 4mm. I am confident in my assessment.\n\nTherefore:\n\nVessel\nIt forms a continuous tubular structure that elongates and branches in the inferior slices, running adjacent to a bronchus.\n4 mm"
